  "scope": "All actual sampled callsites/counters retained; realloc obeys allocation byte budget, actual collector/allocator stack prefix removed after native symbol resolution, read lock released before IP-deduplicated symbolization, collector-thread-only nested panic-safe sampling exclusion. CPU protobuf locations preserve actual resolved native addresses rather than zero, including builds without debug info. When the native resolver omits function base, preserve its genuine sampled instruction pointer instead of inventing or dropping the CPU location."
